<title>USA: Asset Guaranty has capacity for Foothills Eastern.</title>
<headline>Asset Guaranty has capacity for Foothills Eastern.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asset Guaranty Insurance Co. said Wednesday it has secondary market insurance capacity for Foothills Eastern toll road in California.</p>
<p>Capacity is limited and available on a first-come, first-served basis, the company said. For more information, call 212-984-9288.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
